You will probably have less HP but more AC; even when you get reduced to 
0 hp though, you'll just turn back into your high level character. 
Remember, as a vampire lord you get to keep all of your 
weapons/armor/rings/etc. Plus you get the bite attack (including 
leveldrain), flying, very fast, and undeadness. All very nice.

My favorite is a Xorn; you don't get to wear armor or cloaks, but you 
have intrinsic MR and stoning resistance (!), unbreathing, and a nice 
natural AC. Plus the phasing is absolutely wonderful.

