In addition to the already posted suggestions...

The brain sucking is a melee attack. Can you think of any good ways to 
prevent melee attacks on you? :) After that, just pelt it with darts, 
daggers, whatever, until it dies. That's almost certainly the easiest 
way. Or you could grease your helmet to buy at least one turn, or you 
could wear a dunce cap while fighting it. You could make a boulder fort 
and use ranged attacks.

Polyself into black dragon would probably work, but there's still a 
chance he'll get close enough.

